#!args --verify-dirty
# kbnav.uis -- the keyboard between the parts of the dock area (lib/ui/kbnav.rs): F6 / Shift+F6
# visit the tool bar and every group (its tab strip first, later where the focus was last;
# the document area has no focusable widget and is skipped), Tab keeps a group's strip,
# buttons and panel together, F8 the splitters (arrows move
# the focused one by 8 DIP, Shift+arrows by 1; Esc or F8 past the last go back to the widget
# focused before)
theme light
expect text:"Größen: 260/280/200" exists
# ------------------------------------------------------------ F6: the panes
key f6
expect button:"Speichern" focused
key f6
expect tab:"Dateien" focused
# Tab: the group's strip, its buttons, then its panel (a pane's stops stay together)
key tab
expect button:"Weitere Optionen: Dateien" focused
key tab tab tab
expect button:"Datei 1" focused
key tab
expect button:"Datei 2" focused
key f6
expect tab:"Eigenschaften" focused
key shift+f6
expect button:"Datei 2" focused
key f6 f6
expect tab:"Ausgabe" focused
key f6
expect tab:"Suche" focused
key f6
expect button:"Speichern" focused
key shift+f6
expect tab:"Suche" focused
key f6
# ------------------------------------------------------------ F8: the splitters
key f8
expect #3166013428 focused
expect #3166013428 value 260
key right right
expect text:"Größen: 276/280/200" exists
key shift+left
expect text:"Größen: 275/280/200" exists
key f8
expect #4115943472 focused
key left
expect text:"Größen: 275/288/200" exists
key f8
expect #3806917853 focused
key up
expect text:"Größen: 275/288/208" exists
key f8
expect #4218216879 focused
expect tab:"Suche" rect 480 368 80 32
key right
expect tab:"Suche" rect 488 368 80 32
key esc
expect button:"Speichern" focused
key f8 f8 f8 f8 f8
expect button:"Speichern" focused
expect_nowarn
